                "content": "The following SQL returns the ProductName if ALL the records in the \"OrderDetails\" table has Quantity equal to 10. This will of course return FALSE \nbecause the Quantity column has many different values (not only the value of 10):\n\nExample\n\n SELECT ProductName\nFROM Products\nWHERE ProductID = ALL (\n  SELECT ProductID\n  FROM OrderDetails\n  WHERE Quantity = 10\n);\n\n Try it Yourself »\n\n ❮ Previous\n Next ❯\n\n ★\n\n +1\n\n Sign in to track progress\n\n REMOVE ADS",
