                "content": "You choose the timeline and pace of your study plans.\n\nSchools have different preferences.\n\nSome would like more intensive pace, e.g. 4 weeks, others 12 or more weeks.\n\nIt is completely up to you.\n\nFor example, this is how a 4-week SQL study plan could look like:\n\n Week 1: Basic Syntax, Queries\n\n Week 2: Data Manipulation, Functions and operators\n\n Week 3: Joins, Database Design, Constraints and keys\n\n Week 4: SQL Certification Exam\n\nImage of Sample SQL study plan:",
